  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/IMG-20170625-WA0002.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>28 fotos de l&#39;audici&oacute; de final de curs de l&#39;escola de la Uni&oacute; Musical Santa Cec&iacute;lia de Suera, celebrada aquest dissabte, 24 de juny. Han intervingut 30 xiquets i xiquetes i 10 persones adultes del cor. Despr&eacute;s ha hagut berenar per a alumnat i familiars.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/img-20170625-wa0000.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170625-wa0000\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/img-20170625-wa0002.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170625-wa0002\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/img-20170625-wa0003.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170625-wa0003\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/img-20170625-wa0004.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170625-wa0004\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/img-20170625-wa0005.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170625-wa0005\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/img-20170625-wa0006.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170625-wa0006\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/img-20170625-wa0007.jpg\" alt=\"img-20170625-wa0007\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/audiciofinalcursuniomusicalsuera17/im